# This repo is PUBLIC and deploys to klaasm.be. Everything tracked here is world-readable.
# So this file is a privacy control, not tidiness — it exists so build output and local scratch
# can never be swept in by a careless `git add -A`.
#
# The lesson it encodes (2026-07-21, learned the expensive way in the vault repo): a gitignore
# line protecting one subtree says nothing about sibling artifacts, and a prose rule in a docs
# file has failed as a control every time it has been tried. Deny by pattern, not by vigilance.

# graphify build output — AST cache, generated report, rendered graph. Regenerable from source
# (`graphify update .`), so there is no reason to publish it. Verified 2026-08-06 to contain no
# absolute user paths, but it is still build output in a content repo.
graphify-out/

# local scratch / editor / OS noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# anything explicitly marked local — a deliberate escape hatch for drafts that must not ship
*.local.*
/local/
/scratch/
